{"id":"n56324-3-8","stage":3,"title":"바 · 机会或境况。","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56324-3-8-1","ko":"식당에 들어가려면 한 시간을 기다려야 한대.","zh":"据说要进那家餐厅得等一个小时呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"식당에","meaning":"饭店，餐厅","explanation":"식당：饭店，餐厅；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"식당","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36693","senseId":"2","lemma":"식당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"식당에","audio":"/audio/13f982fb2ec487062382.mp3"}},{"text":"들어가려면","meaning":"进，进去","explanation":"들어가다：进，进去；려면：表示实现意图所需的条件：“如果想要……”。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어가려면","audio":"/audio/9b85d0ed2fe642674962.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"限度","explanation":"한：限度","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84551","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"시간을","meaning":"小时","explanation":"시간：小时；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62842","senseId":"1","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간을","audio":"/audio/ef64a5c202c601ff5d8d.mp3"}},{"text":"기다려야","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기다려야","audio":"/audio/f9341d391242c88194da.mp3"}},{"text":"한대.","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；ㄴ대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한대","audio":"/audio/ecbeb5d6ac1f114dc58c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fe047fb6c566f277","term":"식당","zh":"饭店，餐厅","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3","entryId":"36693","definition":"制做并出售食物的商店。","pronunciation":["식땅"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"进，进去","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"由外往里去。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"限度","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"84551","definition":"时间、空间、数量、程度等的极限。","pronunciation":["한ː"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"小时","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62842","definition":"时间单位。表示一天的二十四分之一时长。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c13d7801f5b0f294047e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56324-3-8-2","ko":"그렇게 오래 기다릴 바에는 다른 데에 가자.","zh":"既然要等那么久，咱们去别的地方吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"오래","meaning":"好久，很久","explanation":"오래：好久，很久","readings":[{"term":"오래","audio":"/audio/2f64811b687303a9be76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57308","senseId":"1","lemma":"오래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오래","audio":"/audio/2f64811b687303a9be76.mp3"}},{"text":"기다릴","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기다릴","audio":"/audio/cfda836adb68189230fa.mp3"}},{"text":"바에는","meaning":"机会或境况。","explanation":"바：机会或境况。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"바","audio":"/audio/f6a780a386d59bfa68ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56324","senseId":"3","lemma":"바","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바에는","audio":"/audio/9a1fa90734d042838b5d.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"데에","meaning":"处所，地方。","explanation":"데：处所，地方。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"데","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47455","senseId":"1","lemma":"데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"데에","audio":"/audio/07f056ccb1969aa9caa8.mp3"}},{"text":"가자.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가자","audio":"/audio/9d6a16e0f490c47dce42.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"2f64811b687303a9","term":"오래","zh":"好久，很久","audio":"/audio/2f64811b687303a9be76.mp3","entryId":"57308","definition":"长时间。","pronunciation":["오래"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d",